WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:49.890
How long is Rumaty going to stay in there?

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:52.030
You're asking the wrong guy...

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:53.360
Useless.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:55.360
What do you...

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:59.350
It must have been a shock. He believed in his brother...

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:02.730
Sooner or later, he'll tell us.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:07.410
I wonder what he'll do now...

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:10.060
There's nothing he can do.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:14.800
If Rumaty returns to Raginei, he'll be killed.

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:18.880
B--but... in the last year, since all the fuss...

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:20.880
there haven't been any assassins...

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:24.330
They know he's here, though.

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:27.510
Which means someone is controlling things.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.090
Yes, like my brother, perhaps.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.740
He could take it that far...

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:37.770
Quinza is very smart... He'll overthink it, he won't overdo it.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:41.910
It does worry me a little...

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:45.060
Your Highness!

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:48.340
Lee-Leng, tell Eddie for me. I'm going to do the interview.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:49.640
Rumaty!

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:52.740
I'm going to say that I was falsely accused of the coup d'etat a year ago.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:57.360
And then I'm going to claim my legal right of succession.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:01.630
If you do that, you'll fan the flames of rebellion and turn it into civil war.

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:07.070
If it gets my brother to change his policies, it's enough.

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:10.420
But if it doesn't, I will have from him...

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:11.880
his abdication.

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:13.060
Rumaty!

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:17.030
We have 30 years until the oil runs out.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.530
Until then, if we don't make preparations...

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:22.430
Raginei is on a course for destruction.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.980
We're out of time.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.170
Rumaty!

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:31.120
Wait, Rumaty!

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:36.000
He's serious...

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:43.660
"Bewildered"

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:47.230
Were you serious?

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:49.790
It will cause an uproar!

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:54.440
I spent all night last night thinking about it.

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:55.880
No...

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:59.280
Maybe the truth is I've been thinking about it much longer.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:02.280
As much as I can...

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.810
I want to be on Raginei's side.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:07.820
Rumaty...

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.390
We may be suddenly parted sometime...

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:16.580
I want to say my farewell at once.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:19.160
Stop it, you're scaring me!

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:22.190
I'm truly glad I met you.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.020
You are a friend for life.

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:26.740
You, too!

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:29.990
The Raguran Yahweh...

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.300
Once I put this on, I will never take it off again.

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:36.200
It's the symbol of the heir to the throne.

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:39.710
Please... put it on me with your own hands.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.940
A very assertive accessory...

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:49.740
<i>It's no use trying to stop him now.</i>

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:55.120
<i>He thought about it on his own, and decided on his own.</i>

00:04:56.430 --> 00:05:00.410
<i>When did he get so grown up on his own?</i>

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:05.060
Lovely... it suits you.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:09.590
I want to see you someday, decked out in the clothes of a King.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:14.940
Kajika, when I am King someday...

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:16.730
will you be Queen?

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:19.940
I'm not the Queen type.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.670
But I do have feelings for you.

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:28.510
Can I kiss you? A lover's kiss.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.750
<i>Lee-Leng...</i>

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.390
<i>He...</i>

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:57.750
<i>he averted his eyes!</i>

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:07.750
Kajika.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.200
H--hi...

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.530
<i>"H--hi?"</i>

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.210
<i>That was exactly...</i>

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:25.210
<i>like my brother.</i>

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:30.240
I want to know, now! Is something wrong?

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:34.000
Today is His Highness Somand's day.

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:36.830
Well, then, it's OK if I'm with him.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.440
Master Rumaty, I'm afraid...

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:41.570
<i>Any excuse would do...</i>

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.620
<i>All I wanted was...</i>

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.940
<i>without the interference of the bossy chamberlains...</i>

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.480
<i>to spend time with my brother.</i>

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:55.840
Your Highness is very fond of the Crown Prince.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.030
Of course!

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:59.800
My brother's going to be King.

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:02.950
As his little brother, I have to help him!

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.310
Brother!

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:11.240
Brother...

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:14.960
<i>Set against the memory of my brother...</i>

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:19.390
<i>it lines up perfectly.</i>

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:22.060
<i>Without his realizing it...</i>

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.620
it showed on his face...

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.640
Lee-Leng...

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:31.970
I can't believe it... you...

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.550
So? Was there something you wanted to say to me?

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:41.090
Y--eah, well, I mean...

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:43.650
Mustafa, do you have feelings for me?

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.390
I love you.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.300
S--so, that would mean...

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:52.170
if someone else and I...

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.340
kiss or anything...

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.630
it hurts you?

00:07:56.890 --> 00:07:58.650
It hurts me.

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:00.960
You don't sound that hurt.

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:05.010
But I don't have anyone else to talk to about this.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.170
I wonder who did it.

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:09.350
Ah, Rumaty?

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:11.470
H--how did you know?

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.370
He asked me to be Queen...

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:18.350
and then asked if he could give me a lover's kiss.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:22.180
I didn't get a chance to say "Wait..."

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:26.540
I have feelings for Rumaty.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.960
But these "feelings..."

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:32.720
are the same ones I have for you, or Lee-Leng.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:38.100
Is it OK to say yes with feelings like that?

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.420
Why did you come to me about it?

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.380
Well, out of all my friends...

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:50.020
there's only one who's really, really, reeeeeeeally knowledgeable about this stuff.

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:52.010
And that's you, Mustafa!

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.840
I won't deny it, but...

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:57.760
In the end, I suppose I have to choose...

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:01.800
But I like things best as they are now!

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:04.730
But I suppose...

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.960
that's just selfish.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:13.680
Well, how did it feel? The "lover's kiss?"

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:15.210
How did it feel?

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:19.640
Not really that different from Dad or Maria...

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:22.000
Wanna try?

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:24.830
See how I compare?

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:29.290
Stop!

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:31.860
That's weird.

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:36.300
The "lover's kiss" isn't something you just do with everyone!

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:40.980
Is a "lover" usually someone you pick by comparing?

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:44.300
I understand.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:47.540
If you don't want to choose, you don't have to.

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:49.600
It's no good trying to force it.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.260
Mustafa... do you really love me?

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.650
More than anyone.

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:59.080
Do you want to marry me, like Rumaty?

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:00.880
If it's your wish, yes.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:02.680
And if it's not my wish...

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:05.380
could we stay friends like this forever?

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:09.400
Even if I fell in love with another man, you wouldn't mind?

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:12.940
As long as you're happy, I will be satisfied.

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:15.160
I don't get it.

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:19.720
If you could really take it that calmly, is that really "love?"

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:25.130
Kajika, show me a hundred people...

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:27.520
and I'll show you a hundred different forms of "love."

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:32.980
Some people want it to fit neatly in a box, one way or another...

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:36.220
but the human heart doesn't come with a manual...

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:38.430
does it?

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:42.050
Mine is just an especially unusual type.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:46.320
I guess. But I still don't really get it...

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:48.960
There's no need to force it if you don't.

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:51.790
This is my version of love.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.670
You're better off finding your own.

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:01.060
Just remember this...

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:05.720
Loving someone is never a mistake.

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:09.630
Sadly though it may end...

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:14.250
even your regrets are a part of you.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.470
Wow...

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:18.930
That sounds so beautiful.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:22.150
You don't mess around, Mustafa!

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.020
Are you sure you know what that means?

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:29.030
I knew, if I talked to you, you'd put my mind at ease.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:34.130
Oh, you're meeting someone, aren't you? I'll go, then.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:41.970
This is unusual for you. How long are you planning to hide...

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:44.070
Isabella?

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.780
You just ignored me...

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:51.680
suddenly disappearing like that...

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.340
but I'm used to that kind of thing from you.

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:59.900
I hate standing around talking, and I hate sunburns. Let's talk in the car.

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:03.310
Funny, you liked standing around listening well enough.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:07.210
If you won't say anything nice to me, then I...

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.400
won't give you this.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.860
A party given by King Somand?

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:16.110
Yeah, that's the invitation.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.950
Now, of all times, you look glad...

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:22.230
<i>With this, I can get to Quinza.</i>

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:25.890
Is that for Kajika's sake, too?

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:29.780
I know all about her sheltering Prince Rumaty.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.190
So, what is it you want in exchange?

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:39.020
Give it up, Eugene. I have no use for some self-sacrificing holy man.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:43.540
The Eugene I like doesn't care a whit for anyone else's feelings.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:46.500
You have these delusions about Kajika.

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:49.530
If you love her so much, go to bed with her!

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:52.620
That'll snap you out of it! You'll see she's just an ordinary girl...

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:54.780
I'll never touch her.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:56.970
Eugene...

00:12:57.510 --> 00:13:00.820
As long as I live, I'll never lay a finger on her.

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:06.160
And you won't mind other men having her? She's not a doll!

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:09.150
It will hurt.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:13.390
But that hell is what I dream of.

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:17.910
You're a strange man.

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.450
Because I love her...

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:24.950
I'm prepared to suffer.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.200
<i>I love the happiness and the suffering...</i>

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.860
<i>because the only emotions I feel...</i>

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.890
<i>are the ones you grant me.</i>

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:38.170
<i>A moment of happiness.</i>

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.060
<i>An eternity of suffering.</i>

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.120
<i>If that's how it is...</i>

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:47.600
<i>I want eternity.</i>

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:52.440
<i>I want to take my last breath...</i>

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.500
<i>wrapped in your tender thorns.</i>

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:05.290
Yes, there will also be an elders' council meeting.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.020
The link-up is arranged at the hotel.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:11.670
Right.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:13.400
<i>What do I say?</i>

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:17.860
<i>"I didn't know." ...It's no use.</i>

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:24.200
<i>If you told me a band of assassins had just burst in, it wouldn't scare me like this.</i>

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.030
Your Highness.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.360
I've been meaning to visit you.

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.910
<i>Lee-Leng...</i>

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:35.000
<i>He's angry</i>

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:39.580
We've gotten the government of Singapore to agree to accept Your Highness.

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:43.500
Depending on what happens in the interview, though...

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:47.100
things could become delicate with them, too.

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:49.780
<i>What is he doing?</i>

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.440
<i>What is that?</i>

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:56.280
<i>I see.</i>

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:59.960
<i>You're going to be sneaky about it, are you?</i>

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:03.670
Just come out and say it! You're pissed at me!

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:06.690
Why are you deliberately acting like that?

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:10.740
I don't understand. What are you talking about?

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:14.660
Don't play dumb! You -- you saw me...

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:17.560
you saw me kiss...

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:19.310
kiss Kajika.

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:24.150
You saw it, and you were angry.

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:31.410
I am currently discussing Your Highness' future.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.720
Singapore is the stronghold of the Huang family.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:37.940
For you to be welcomed there...

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:41.000
is as good as announcing to the world...

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.960
that the Huang family opposes King Somand.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:50.170
This is a huge gamble for the Huang Group.

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:55.650
I'd rather not have a matter that serious dealt with as if...

00:15:56.960 --> 00:16:01.700
it's on the same level as some discussion about kissing. It's offensive.

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:07.760
Liar... you do care about Kajika...

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:12.930
very, very much! More than Huang, or Raginei, or me...

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:15.570
<i>He's in a state...</i>

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:17.730
that's how much she means to you! How can you lie like that?

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:17.830
<i>of total panic</i>

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:23.360
I think you should pause for a moment.

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:29.260
The person I wish to speak to is the next leader of Raginei.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:31.460
I don't have time for a spoiled brat.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.780
You!

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:42.160
You have no idea how I feel!

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:47.160
You're just like my brother! Smiling sweetly while you build a wall!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:52.070
You never let anything touch you! If you love her, say so!

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:55.630
Maybe you want to spend your whole life and never tell Kajika...

00:16:56.110 --> 00:17:00.190
But I'm going to say it! To Kajika, and to you!

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:03.550
The truth is...

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:07.130
you want Kajika too!

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:15.260
Dry yourself off!

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:24.210
What a mess.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:28.500
Rumaty!

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:30.930
What are you doing here?

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:36.120
Hey, Rumaty, Mustafa told me something really great.

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:38.600
Which isn't a big surprise, really...

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:41.570
Rumaty?

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:45.680
You threw water in his face?

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.420
He's probably mad.

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:50.740
Really mad.

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:55.030
Well, what did you do?

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:58.130
So what were you going to apologize for?

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:04.330
What? Is there something you can't tell me?

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:08.110
It's kind of... it's a man-to-man thing!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:14.090
Okay, fine. But at any rate, go back over there.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:18.170
Going there to apologize and throwing a drink in his face instead?

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:19.730
Not very logical.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:24.950
I was scared.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.700
When I thought he was mad at me, I got scared...

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:32.030
and I put on the bravado to hide it.

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:33.810
What are you talking about?

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:36.360
This from the guy who's decided to raid Raginei?

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:40.430
That's totally different! I'm fully prepared for that...

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:44.700
but fighting with Lee-Leng takes a lot more courage!

00:18:45.530 --> 00:18:49.540
And in light of that, I got a loud splash of water to the face.

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:52.950
L--Lee-Leng...

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:58.210
O--OK, now you're even.

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:02.130
S--sour... and c--cold...

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:07.670
Grapefruit juice is much worse than water, right? It even had ice...

00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:14.580
Fighting fire with fire just leads to a war.

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:16.100
Here.

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:19.170
Negotiation is a wiser path.

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:24.010
Plus, when a third party gets involved it only complicates things.

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:27.550
Really? Well, here goes the third party.

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:31.560
See you two later! My, what a nice day...

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.820
I'm sorry about the water.

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.860
No matter how I look at it, it was wrong.

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:43.810
I'm very sorry.

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:45.510
Your Highness...

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:49.240
As for Kajika, don't spare my feelings.

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:53.220
If I lose to you, I'll have no regrets.

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:55.960
Thank you.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:59.180
I, ah, really hate sour things...

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.550
<i>Look at that smile...</i>

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:06.760
Your Highness, let's go to Singapore.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:13.990
-- Camera 1 is good, raise Camera 2
-- Bottom right spotlight, a little further down!

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:22.620
I do not approve! Making an enemy of King Somand now?

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:25.490
Certainly there's no reason to make the first move.

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:29.440
There will be plenty of time after we see which way the country is going.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:34.310
Please don't misunderstand me. This is not a consultation.

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:39.310
I merely came to tell you my decision as leader of the Huang.

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:41.990
As elders, it is not in your power...

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:44.890
to overturn that decision.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:50.240
So, Your Highness, do you intend to reconcile with King Somand?

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:54.830
Of course. When my brother stops ruling as an iron-fisted dictator...

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:57.820
and the order banishing me is withdrawn...

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:01.390
I will serve my brother with pleasure.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:06.230
That is the true reconciliation that God and the people want.

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:11.140
<i>You care about Kajika, very, very much!</i>

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:15.150
<i>She matters more to you than Huang, or Raginei, or me!</i>

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:20.880
My older brother has no idea how grave the state of society is.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.230
If his advisors are going to let him stay that way...

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:27.000
then I will have to open his eyes.

00:21:27.860 --> 00:21:30.500
I consider it my duty.

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:34.130
<i>If you love her, say so!</i>

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:37.960
<i>If I could tell her, I'd have done it long ago!</i>

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:46.880
<i>The truth is... you want Kajika too!</i>

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:50.030
So you're saying, as a first step...

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:54.430
United Nations inspectors should be allowed into the country...

00:21:55.090 --> 00:21:58.020
but the King is currently refusing them entry?

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:00.830
He can't refuse them forever.

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:04.620
If nothing were wrong, there wouldn't be unrest among the people.

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:08.410
<i>If I lose to you, I'll have no regrets.</i>

00:22:12.070 --> 00:22:14.910
<i>The Huang blood that runs through my veins...</i>

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:18.160
<i>won't let me say it even in jest.</i>

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:23.190
<i>But His Highness... he...</i>

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:26.730
<i>it's never troubled him.</i>

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:29.910
<i>His graciousness...</i>

00:22:32.300 --> 00:22:33.990
<i>is enviable...</i>

00:22:35.390 --> 00:22:38.070
<i>Precious</i>

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:43.740
And in the event that the King refuses to comply, what will you do?

00:22:46.440 --> 00:22:49.920
In that event... I will return.

00:22:50.270 --> 00:22:52.170
I don't care if it's only one...

00:22:52.340 --> 00:22:55.200
if a voice among my people asks for me...

00:22:55.740 --> 00:22:57.410
nothing will stop me.

00:22:59.130 --> 00:23:00.680
I will return.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
